Z||000000||Richard Parnell||11-13-2000||02:26 AM||||Now that I've got my 87 SC w/v8 up and running, I've been cruising and putting a lot of miles on the car having fun just driving it and breaking in the Center Force clutch slowly.  Funny thing is, it used to be when I would drive around in my Fiero, I would seem to continually have Camaros or Vettes or swarms of ricers buggin' the hell out of me on the freeway.  Now that I'm out with the big dog, I haven't yet come acoss one single one of the types that used to harass the hell out of me.  What gives?  I'm waiting.  The car looks totally stock except for the nice dual exhaust.  I can hardly wait.  Not that I plan on going real fast.  I just want to goose it for a second or two.||||reg||10
